Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:07.93,Chinese,C05-15-S01,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}这一方案从六千六百七十九人出发，抵达观测时是六千六百八十九人，净增十人。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:07.93,English,C05-15-S01,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1030)}This plan started with 6,679 soldiers. At the arrival observation it had 6,689, a net gain of 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.53,0:00:13.66,Chinese,C05-15-S02,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}完整二十七个兵团都还在，满员数仍是六千七百四十七。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.53,0:00:13.66,English,C05-15-S02,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1030)}All 27 regiments were still present, and their total maximum soldier count remained 6,747.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.30,0:00:18.43,Chinese,C05-15-S03,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}补给从约一百一十点三八变为一百零六点一四。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.30,0:00:18.43,English,C05-15-S03,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1030)}Supply went from about 110.38 to 106.14.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.03,0:00:21.73,Chinese,C05-15-S04,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}净增十人只说旅途两端的差，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.03,0:00:21.73,English,C05-15-S04,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1030)}The gain of 10 is only the difference between the two endpoints.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.10,0:00:27.16,Chinese,C05-15-S05,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}不表示途中没有死伤，也不表示已经逐次读到了补员结算。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.10,0:00:27.16,English,C05-15-S05,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1008)}It does not mean there were no casualties along the way,\Nor that every reinforcement update was observed.
